msgstr "'{1}' ma’lum jild ham, dir ID ham emas (ma’lum jildlar: ProgramFiles, ProgramFiles32, CommonFiles, AppData, LocalAppData, CommonAppData, StartMenu, Programs, Desktop, Windows, System, Fonts, Temp)"

